#import "../tcc.typ": bloco-resumo

// Abstract: mesmo conteúdo do resumo, em inglês, em um único parágrafo
// (manual, 5.2.10).
#bloco-resumo(
  [ABSTRACT],
  [
    This work presents the development of a technical project carried out by
    students of the technical course. The objective was to verify the viability
    of a solution for the studied problem. The methodology adopted was
    bibliographic research and laboratory tests. The results showed that the
    proposed solution meets the defined requirements. It is concluded that the
    project is viable and can be applied in practice, with the necessary
    adaptations.
  ],
  [Keywords],
  "professional education; technical project; viability",
)
